        itemId = 63378,
        name = "Hellscream's Reach Tabard",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Requires Honored reputation and daily-quest currency over repeated visits; the purchase itself is guaranteed.\n\n1. Use a Horde character and check Hellscream's Reach in the reputation panel. You need Honored and 40 spendable Tol Barad Commendations on the buying character. You do not need the Tol Barad achievement meta or an old PvP season rating.\n\n2. In Orgrimmar, go to the Western Earthshrine, on the elevated northern Cataclysm portal platform around 50.6,38.6. Take the portal to Tol Barad Peninsula. The daily-quest peninsula is the northern island; you do not need to enter the southern PvP battle or Baradin Hold to buy this tabard.\n\n3. At Hellscream's Grasp on Tol Barad Peninsula (55.0,80.0), accept all offered faction dailies. Follow their objective areas, complete the kill/collection/rescue tasks and return to the camp to turn them in. The quests award both faction reputation and commendations; unfinished objectives alone do not pay either reward.\n\n4. Repeat the available peninsula dailies after daily resets until you have BOTH Honored reputation and 40 commendations. Save those 40 instead of spending them on mounts, pets or reputation tokens. This route works without winning or controlling the southern battle island, so you can continue even when no battle group is available.\n\n5. Return to Pogg at 54.6,80.8 on the same Peninsula map. Set the shop filter to All, find Hellscream's Reach Tabard (63378) and buy it for 40 commendations. If the item is red, check the buyer's reputation and currency separately.\n\n6. Equip the tabard and keep it. Its on-use effect returns you to Hellscream's Grasp; that camp also has a portal back to your faction capital. Transmog alone does not provide the teleport. Do not follow old comments recommending a refund after collecting or using it: a refund can remove a collection unlock, and using the teleport can end refund eligibility.",
        sourceType = "Reputation",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=63378",
