        name = "Tabard of the Guardians of Hyjal",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Opening Mount Hyjal quests unlock a cheap purchase at the first hub.\n\n1. Check Guardians of Hyjal reputation. If already Friendly, go directly to step 4. This is the original Mount Hyjal questing faction; Avengers of Hyjal, earned in the Firelands raid, is a different reputation and does not satisfy this purchase.\n\n2. If the zone introduction is new, take Hero's Call: Mount Hyjal! from Stormwind's board at 63.1,71.4 or Warchief's Command: Mount Hyjal! from Orgrimmar's board at 49.8,76.4. Follow the introduction to Moonglade, then use Aronus at 46.0,45.5 for the As Hyjal Burns flight to Nordrassil. If your Mount Hyjal portal is already unlocked, use it to reach the same starting hub.\n\n3. At Nordrassil, speak with Ysera around 62.0,24.8. Follow Protect the World Tree to Malfurion Stormrage at the Tranquil Grove, 47.6,35.5. Complete his local defense and Flameseer quests, checking for Guardians of Hyjal reputation in the rewards. Continue the opening story until Friendly; you can stop for the tabard without unlocking the later Molten Front dailies.\n\n4. Enter Nordrassil Inn, the building by the first arrival point, at 62.8,23.8 in Mount Hyjal. Find Provisioner Whitecloud just inside on the right. The female Tauren quartermaster can be present before you finish the zone; if her tabard is red, the remaining gate is your reputation.\n\n5. Buy Tabard of the Guardians of Hyjal (65906) for up to 1 gold and equip it. Check the name before buying: the similarly styled Cenarion Expedition Tabard belongs to a separate Outland faction. The cosmetic is obtained at Friendly, so Exalted is optional.",
